eight: 240px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 232.5%; height: 240px;\" colspan=\"11\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Join Indian Navy (Nausena Bharti)</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Navy Apprentice 01/2027 &amp; 02/2027 Batch Recruitment 2026</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Navy Agniveer INET 02/2026 : Short Details of Notification</b></span></h3>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #ff0000;\"><b> </b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 250px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 250px; width: 56.8558%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin :<b>05/06/2026</b></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>29/06/2026 upto 05 PM</b></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date :<b>29/06/2026</b></li>\n<li>Correction Date : <strong>06/07/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Exam Date :<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b> August 2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <b>Before Exam</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 91.49%; height: 250px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><b style=\"color: #008000; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit;\">Application Fee</b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>General (UR) / OBC / EWS : <b>550/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST : <b>550/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through UPI, Debit Card, Credit Card and Net Banking Mode Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"11\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Navy Agniveer Apprentices Notification 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Age Limit Details</b></span></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Navy Agniveer Apprentices 01/2027 Batch Age Limit : <b>01/12/2004 – 31/05/2009</b></li>\n<li>Navy Agniveer Apprentices 02/2027 Batch Age Limit : <b>01/05/2005 – 31/10/2009</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 232.5%;\" colspan=\"11\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Navy Agniveer Apprentices Recruitment 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Vacancy Details</b></span></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 15.865%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"3\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 216.635%; height: 186px;\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"2\"><strong>Indian Navy Agniveer Apprentices Eligibility</strong><p></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Only for Unmarried Male Candidates</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Class 10th Matric with 50% Minimum Marks and 3 Year Diploma from AICTE / Polytechnic with Minimum 50% Marks.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Engineering Trade :</strong> Marine Engineering &amp; Systems, Mechanical, Production/ Automobile, Refrigeration and Air Conditioning, Repair and Maintenance, Power Plant Engineering, Industrial/Production, Maintenance, Machine, Manufacturing/ Manufacturing Technology, Mechatronics, Metallurgy, Instrumentation, Electronics Instrumentation and Control Engineering.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Electrical Trade :</strong> Electrical, Electronics &amp; Communication, Instrumentation Technology, Electronics, Electrical and Electronics, Electronics Instrumentation and Control Engineering.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 161px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 15.865%; text-align: center; height: 161px;\" colspan=\"3\">Navy Agniveer Apprentices INET 02/2026</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 232.5%; height: 104px;\" colspan=\"11\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Navy Agniveer Apprentices Physical Eligibility Details 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Running :</strong> 1.6 Km Run in 06 Min 30 Second</li>\n<li><strong>Squats Uthak Baithak :</strong> 20</li>\n<li><strong>Push Ups :</strong> 15</li>\n<li><strong>Bent Knee (Sit Ups) :</strong> 15</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 401px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 232.5%; height: 370px;\" colspan=\"11\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>Indian Navy Agniveer INET 02/2026 Batch Recruitment 2026 Candidate Can Apply Between <b>05/06/2026&nbsp; to 29/06/2026</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Indian Navy Agniveer Apprentices 01/2027 &amp; 02/2027 Batch Recruitment 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 232.5%; height: 104px;\" colspan=\"11\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 146px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 232.5%; height: 146px;\" colspan=\"11\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 10px; width: 56.8558%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 91.49%; height: 10px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 232.5%; text-align: center; height: 62px;\" colspan=\"11\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"tex