in <strong>August 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>3. Where can I find the syllabus for the Indian Navy Agniveer Apprentices INET 02/2026 Examination?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed syllabus and examination scheme for the Indian Navy Nausena Bharti Agniveer Apprentices Examination are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete syllabus details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>4. Indian Navy Agniveer Apprentices INET 02/2026 Notification PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the notification through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>5. Indian Navy Agniveer Apprentices INET 02/2026 Recruitment Last Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>29 June 2026..</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>6. What is the last date to Update application fee Details?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">29 June 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>7. How can I apply for Indian Navy Agniveer Apprentices INET 02/2026 Exam?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>.\n<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_22383\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-22383\" style=\"width: 1459px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-22383\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201469%20959'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"Indian Navy Agniveer Apprentices INET 02/2026\" width=\"1469\" height=\"959\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet022026.png 1469w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet022026-300x196.png 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet022026-1024x668.png 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet022026-768x501.png 768w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 1469px) 100vw, 1469px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet022026.png\"><noscript><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-22383\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet022026.png\" alt=\"Indian Navy Agniveer Apprentices INET 02/2026\" width=\"1469\" height=\"959\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet022026.png 1469w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet022026-300x196.png 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet022026-1024x668.png 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet022026-768x501.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1469px)